<u>OTHER FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> \u2013 Fight with style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Rank</strong> \u2013 Show off your skills and dedication!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your weapons mid-game to survive longer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
